BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T210000
DTSTAMP:20260504T222932
CREATED:20260503T131138Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260504T131647Z
UID:17054-1778349600-1778360400@www.nlgja.org
SUMMARY:LA Press Pride Prom
DESCRIPTION:This year\, our LA chapter’s annual benefit and awards ceremony is dedicated to the queer and trans folks who came before us\, resisting\, loving\, thriving and setting the stage for the next generation to continue building on that legacy. \nWe’ve been here\, and we’ll always be here. Now\, let’s party! \n\n\n\n\n\nGet Your Tickets Today! \n\n\n\n\nJoin us at Press Pride Prom as we honor Southern California’s LGBTQ+ history and celebrate the journalists documenting queer and trans life today! \nNow more than ever\, it’s imperative that we get to document and tell our stories. With your help\, we can raise money to provide scholarships for emerging LGBTQ+ journalists and continue to develop programming that centers the needs of Southern California’s queer and trans media types of all stripes. \nPress Pride Prom is a celebration with purpose. Your support fuels our mission — get your tickets today!
URL:https://www.nlgja.org/event/17054/
LOCATION:LA LGBT Center
CATEGORIES:Chapters
END:VEVENT
